#: ../../../hwmon/mpq8646.rst:213
msgid ""
"per-fault-class recovery-mode configuration (NOT a retry count). Four 4-bit "
"fields [15:12]=OTP, [11:8]=VOUT_OV, [7:4]=VOUT_UV, [3:0]=OCP. Each field: "
"0x0=latch-off, 0x1..0xE=retry N times then latch off, 0xF=hiccup (retry "
"indefinitely). The chip exposes no in-NVM retry-event counter; track "
"transitions externally if needed (poll ``protection_last`` or watch "
"``inX_alarm`` / ``temp1_alarm`` ``poll(POLLPRI)`` wakes)."
