#: ../../../hwmon/mpq8646.rst:250
msgid "Unsafe provisioning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/mpq8646.rst:252
msgid ""
"Available only when ``CONFIG_SENSORS_MPQ8646_DEBUG_UNSAFE=y`` (``default "
"n``, it is for boards bring up only). They WRITE to the regulator. On many "
"designs the MPQ8646 powers the main CPU core rail, so a wrong write can "
"brown out the board or persist a bad setpoint into finite-cycle NVM. "
"WARNING: Some wrong register writes can and likely will physically damage or "
"destroy the chip and/or the board. An explicit warning banner is printed at "
"probe time when this option is enabled."
msgstr ""

